Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The distributed npm dependencies keep their own licenses; their license texts ship inside
node_modules and are not modified by this project.

ImageForge bundles the upstream artifacts listed below. Each one is **unmodified**, its SHA-256
digest is pinned in the registry and verified before use, and its upstream revision, license text
and reproduction steps are recorded in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/ under the project it comes from.

Root managers and their ramdisk payloads, all GPL:

  * Magisk         - https://github.com/topjohnwu/Magisk          (GPL-3.0)
  * WeaveMask      - https://github.com/Seyud/WeaveMask           (GPL-3.0, a fork of Magisk)
  * MagisKube      - https://github.com/SunRayEx/Magisk-Metro     (GPL-3.0, a fork of Magisk)
  * KernelSU       - https://github.com/tiann/KernelSU            (wrapper GPL-3.0-or-later,
                                                                   kernel modules GPL-2.0-only)
  * SukiSU-Ultra   - https://github.com/SukiSU-Ultra/SukiSU-Ultra (same split)
  * ReSukiSU       - https://github.com/ReSukiSU/ReSukiSU         (same split)
  * YukiSU         - https://github.com/Rouyashiki/YukiSU         (same split)
  * KowSU          - https://github.com/zaominn/KowSU             (same split, built from
                                                                   KOWX712/KernelSU)
  * APatch         - https://github.com/bmax121/APatch            (GPL-3.0-or-later)
  * KernelPatch    - https://github.com/bmax121/KernelPatch       (GPL-2.0-or-later)
  * KernelPatch-Aster - https://github.com/LyraVoid/KernelPatch-Aster (GPL-2.0-or-later)
  * LyraVoid/KernelPatch - https://github.com/LyraVoid/KernelPatch    (GPL-2.0-or-later, the
                                                                       branch FolkPatch ships)

The components whose upstream is GPL-3.0-or-later or GPL-2.0-or-later are bundled as separate
programs and are compatible with this project's license. The KernelSU family's kernel modules are
GPL-2.0-only, which **cannot** be combined with AGPL-3.0-or-later: they are therefore neither
linked nor merged into this project. They are redistributed exactly as their projects distribute
them — as separate, unmodified programs, each under its own license, each with the upstream
revision and the corresponding source named in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/.

Codecs and libraries:

  * liblz4 1.10.0  (BSD-2-Clause) - public/wasm/lz4.wasm, the reference LZ4 codec
  * bzip2 1.0.8    (BSD-like)    - public/wasm/bzip2.wasm, the reference bzip2 decompressor

Our own WebAssembly module (public/wasm/imageforge.wasm) is compiled from crates/imageforge-wasm
and links two permissively licensed Rust crates:

  * lzma-rust2 0.21.0 (Apache-2.0 OR MIT) - xz / LZMA2 streams
  * bzip2-rs 0.1.2 (MIT OR Apache-2.0) - bzip2 decoding for OTA payload blobs

See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/rust-crates/README.md for details.

Nothing else is bundled: no other third-party code, binary or dataset is part of this repository
or of the produced site.

